2026-09-25T22:08:45.4508143Z     Features
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4508205Z     --------
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4508268Z     
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4508606Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4508671Z     
