2026-09-25T22:08:45.4508944Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509073Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509129Z     
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509319Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509446Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509513Z     
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509690Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509770Z       test suites out of the box
2026-09-25T22:08:45.4509836Z     
